  {
    "topic": "相机资源与焦点",
    "sources": [
      {
        "source": "S03#T-Multi-Window_Resources",
        "url": "https://developer.android.com/docs/quality-guidelines/adaptive-app-quality/tier-3#T-Multi-Window_Resources",
        "normative_quotes": [
          "T-Multi-Window_Resources Multi-Resume In the app, open the camera or use the microphone. Open another app, and make the new app the top focused app. Verify that the non-focused app has relinquished the camera or mic. Make the original app the top focused app. Verify that the app has regained access to the camera or mic."
        ],
        "snapshot_sha256": "bdf68ed6cb5a65da2c3e3669abf705259cfe2ea873976fd148c9da67d44d084b"
      },
      {
        "source": "S10#exclusive_resource_access",
        "url": "https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/adaptive/support-multi-window-mode#exclusive_resource_access",
        "normative_quotes": [],
        "snapshot_sha256": "de03448de14096722ecbb44eb28378ec08471aa6963db0f4a98491299bf5b3f0"
      },
      {
        "source": "S13#exclusive_resources",
        "url": "https://developer.android.com/media/camera/camera2/camera-preview#exclusive_resources",
        "normative_quotes": [],
        "snapshot_sha256": "4e1dfc048ae049c46ab62ce1fec2c6e45df07ef82abea9acc2c1ec1973441a90"
      }
    ],
    "handling": "Tier 3 测试描述要求失焦后让出资源，实现文档允许无争用时继续预览。仅持续预览不单独判错；核对实际抢占、断开和恢复。"
  },
  {
    "topic": "App 整体留边",
    "sources": [
      {
        "source": "S03#Config_Changes",
        "url": "https://developer.android.com/docs/quality-guidelines/adaptive-app-quality/tier-3#Config_Changes",
        "normative_quotes": [
          "Config_Changes T-Config_Orientation , T-Config_State App fills the available display area—the entire screen or, in multi-window mode, the app window. Content does not overflow the available display area. App is not letterboxed ; it does not run in compatibility mode . App handles configuration changes and retains or restores its state as the device goes through configuration changes such as device rotation, folding and unfolding, and window resizing in split‑screen and desktop windowing modes, for example: Scroll position of scrollable fields is maintained Text typed into text fields is retained and the keyboard state is restored Media playback resumes where it left off when the configuration change was initiated"
        ],
        "snapshot_sha256": "bdf68ed6cb5a65da2c3e3669abf705259cfe2ea873976fd148c9da67d44d084b"
      },
      {
        "source": "S04#Fullscreen_Display",
        "url": "https://developer.android.com/docs/quality-guidelines/core-app-quality#Fullscreen_Display",
        "normative_quotes": [
          "Fullscreen_Display T-Orientation_Transitions App fills the app window in both orientations and is not letterboxed because of configuration changes, including device folding and unfolding. Minor letterboxing to compensate for small variations in screen geometry is acceptable."
        ],
        "snapshot_sha256": "2d6a4f5442e67a0341260bac1829cfc1275f16799b9f37ea1a026f45bbacc064"
      }
    ],
    "handling": "Core 允许补偿微小几何变化的少量留边，Tier 3 测试要求无 App letterbox/compat mode。区分 App 整体加框、媒体留边与系统区域；无法确定时待确认。"
  },
