    "handling": "Play 帮助页折叠截图每边 960–3840px，CLI 指南给出较低捕获范围。发布用帮助页类型专属要求；不据捕获/商店尺寸判定 App 适配。"
  },
  {
    "topic": "Core 行长和字号单位",
    "sources": [
      {
        "source": "S04#Line_Length",
        "url": "https://developer.android.com/docs/quality-guidelines/core-app-quality#Line_Length",
        "normative_quotes": [
          "Line_Length T-Line_Length App ensures readability of text and text blocks by limiting line length to 45-75 characters (including spaces) for each of the app's supported languages."
        ],
        "snapshot_sha256": "2d6a4f5442e67a0341260bac1829cfc1275f16799b9f37ea1a026f45bbacc064"
      },
      {
        "source": "S04#Visual_Contrast",
        "url": "https://developer.android.com/docs/quality-guidelines/core-app-quality#Visual_Contrast",
        "normative_quotes": [
          "Visual_Contrast T-Visual_Contrast App text and foreground content maintain the following contrast ratios with the app background: 3:1 for large text and graphics 4.5:1 for small text (less than 18 pt or less than 14 pt if text is bold) Learn more about color and contrast ."
        ],
        "snapshot_sha256": "2d6a4f5442e67a0341260bac1829cfc1275f16799b9f37ea1a026f45bbacc064"
      },
      {
        "source": "S60",
        "url": "https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/ui/accessibility/apps",
        "normative_quotes": [],
        "snapshot_sha256": "42eed9447a0054e81771994c1bca3226692ae17006fcd016f18afbd1261db42e"
      }
    ],
    "handling": "行长不强行套短标签/末行，疑义核对文本上下文。Core 字号阈值用 pt，Android 说明用 sp；不能用缩放 PNG 像素代入。"
  },
